 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 40.1pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\">주민등록등본 또는 가족관계증명서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;\">가족관계 확인용으로 본인 및 가족 생년월일이</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">필요하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕;\">서류 발급시 주민등록번호 뒷자리 비공개 선택으로 발급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 40.1pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: 700; text-indent: 0px;\">3) 개인정보 수집 이용 동의서 1부 </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">동의서는 신청자 2명 모두 제출해주세요.</span></p><p class=\"0\" 